Mediastinal Pancreatic Pseudocyst</article-title><source>Endoscopy</source><year>2004</year><volume>36</volume><fpage>467</fpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">15100970</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1055/s-2004-814385</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B10"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Kozarek</surname><given-names>RA</given-names></name><name><surname>Ball</surname><given-names>TJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Patterson</surname><given-names>DJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Freeny</surname><given-names>PC</given-names></name><name><surname>Ryan</surname><given-names>JA</given-names></name><name><surname>Traverso</surname><given-names>LW</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Endoscopic transpapillary therapy for disrupted pancreatic duct and peripancreatic fluid collections</article-title><source>Gastroenterology</source><year>1991</year><volume>100</volume><fpage>1362</fpage><lpage>70</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">2013381</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B11"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Cooperman</surname><given-names>AM</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>An overview of pancreatic pseudocysts the emperor's new clothes revisited</article-title><source>Surg Clin North Am</source><year>2001</year><volume>81</volume><fpage>391</fpage><lpage>397</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">11392425</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1016/S0039-6109(05)70126-2</pub-id></citation></ref></ref-list></back></article>